te":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79050,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b160b30b45f81b14e813500ca187622e","RawContent":"I would also love to see everything! If you wouldnt mind...my email is jaspbri0317@aol.com thank you [emoji2]","Attachments":[],"Id":1893159,"PostDate":1429068530,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I would also love to see everything! If you wouldnt mind...my email is jaspbri0317@aol.com thank you [emoji2] \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jaspbri0317@aol.com","IpAddress":"71.58.144.195","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1296688027,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-236302.jpg?_r=1429022808","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jaspbri0317","Id":236302,"Name":"jaspbri0317","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"206.74.64.116","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79050,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"607356033be3aa092c816e0df5b9789b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@&lt;span&gt;&lt;a  class=\"\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282082-jnvoigt\/\" title=\"\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;jnvoigt&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thank you so much for sharing! You had the cutest ideas!!&amp;nbsp; Looks like you had an amazing wedding!&amp;nbsp; Its so funny you said that about the dress, because I just posted on here about flying with your dress!!&amp;nbsp; I have one- question?&amp;nbsp; How did you do with the heat?&amp;nbsp; Were your guests very hot sitting in the sun during the ceremony.&amp;nbsp; How was the reception outdoors?&amp;nbsp; Thank you so much!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Christine&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1893590,"PostDate":1429424104,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282082-jnvoigt\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span>jnvoigt<\/span><\/a><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thank you so much for sharing! You had the cutest ideas!!\u00a0 Looks like you had an amazing wedding!\u00a0 Its so funny you said that about the dress, because I just posted on here about flying with your dress!!\u00a0 I have one- question?\u00a0 How did you do with the heat?\u00a0 Were your guests very hot sitting in the sun during the ceremony.\u00a0 How was the reception outdoors?\u00a0 Thank you so much!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Christine<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cwright1320@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"72.230.115.231","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1388165078,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Cwright","Id":275744,"Name":"Cwright","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"98.25.136.128","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79050,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"64dcca95979dc28396a39e7cfa2a68b2","RawContent":"Hey Christine\n\nThanks and yes it was ! The heat was only bad at the ceremony  which was at 430 pm and it felt like it was beating on us. I gave everyone paper fans so they were ok but we were hot. My hubby was sweating when he walked back down the Isle with me for sure ! But as soon as we were done and could get some shade we were good. The reception was great and it didn&#039;t feel too hot at all. Some guys did change to shorts though !\n\nHope that helps and good luck with the planning !","Attachments":[],"Id":1893871,"PostDate":1429663525,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hey Christine<br>\nThanks and yes it was ! The heat was only bad at the ceremony  which was at 430 pm and it felt like it was beating on us. I gave everyone paper fans so they were ok but we were hot. My hubby was sweating when he walked back down the Isle with me for sure ! But as soon as we were done and could get some shade we were good. The reception was great and it didn't feel too hot at all. Some guys did change to shorts though !<br>\nHope that helps and good luck with the planning !\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Si